---
// Original BotPlanet graphic — pool size & shape suitability.
// Conceptual; illustrates matching a robot to pool length and layout.
---
<figure class="dgm">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 260" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Robot suitability by pool size and shape: small above-ground, mid rectangular, and large free-form pools need different runtime, cable reach and navigation.">
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="640" height="260" rx="14" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--border)"/>
    <!-- small round -->
    <g>
      <circle cx="105" cy="110" r="52" fill="#173a4d" opacity="0.8" stroke="#3a4a66" stroke-width="4"/>
      <rect x="98" y="103" width="16" height="9" rx="2" fill="#4fd1c5"/>
      <text x="105" y="190" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#f5f5f7" text-anchor="middle">Small · round</text>
      <text x="105" y="208" font-size="11" fill="#8b8b95" text-anchor="middle">above-ground</text>
      <text x="105" y="224" font-size="11" fill="#c9c9d1" text-anchor="middle">Flat floor, short runtime OK</text>
    </g>
    <!-- mid rectangle -->
    <g>
      <rect x="250" y="70" width="140" height="82" rx="8" fill="#173a4d" opacity="0.8" stroke="#3a4a66" stroke-width="4"/>
      <rect x="312" y="106" width="16" height="9" rx="2" fill="#7c93ff"/>
      <text x="320" y="190" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#f5f5f7" text-anchor="middle">Mid · rectangular</text>
      <text x="320" y="208" font-size="11" fill="#8b8b95" text-anchor="middle">in-ground, up to ~40 ft</text>
      <text x="320" y="224" font-size="11" fill="#c9c9d1" text-anchor="middle">Wall climb + solid runtime</text>
    </g>
    <!-- large freeform -->
    <g>
      <path d="M470 120 C 470 78, 520 66, 560 78 C 600 90, 610 74, 612 110 C 614 146, 566 156, 528 150 C 490 144, 470 158, 470 120 Z" fill="#173a4d" opacity="0.8" stroke="#3a4a66" stroke-width="4"/>
      <rect x="533" y="108" width="16" height="9" rx="2" fill="#e0b657"/>
      <text x="541" y="190" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#f5f5f7" text-anchor="middle">Large · free-form</text>
      <text x="541" y="208" font-size="11" fill="#8b8b95" text-anchor="middle">50 ft+, curves &amp; steps</text>
      <text x="541" y="224" font-size="11" fill="#c9c9d1" text-anchor="middle">Long runtime + smart nav</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="note">Pool length sets the runtime or cable reach you need; shape and steps decide how much smart navigation matters. Bigger, curvier pools demand more of both.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>.dgm{margin:0}.dgm svg{max-width:640px}.dgm .note{margin-top:8px}</style>
